# Required. AppKit (the wallet connect modal) cannot start without it, and it is
# the only route to a wallet on a phone, so the app throws on boot if it is
# missing. Create a project at https://dashboard.reown.com and paste its id.
#
# Not a secret: it identifies the app to the WalletConnect relay and ships in the
# client bundle. The deploy passes it as a plain repository variable.
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
